{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-2",
  "title": "Onboarding Form",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "reviewing",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Onboarding Form"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Below is a **comprehensive breakdown** of how you might design a **customer onboarding**, **interactive form**, and **rate calculator** to streamline your subscription-based or retainer services model. This structure will help you collect critical project details, guide prospects to the right plan, and start each client relationship on a clear, professional footing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Overall Flow: From Form to Onboarding**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Entry Point**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A link on your website (“Get Started” or “Calculate Your Plan”), shared proposal link, or direct outreach funnel (e.g., email)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- The client clicks to access the **interactive form** or **rate calculator**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Form / Calculator Completion**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- The client answers questions related to project scope, concurrency needs, and timeline expectations."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- The form outputs a recommended plan or retainer tier."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Optionally, the client can select add-ons (consulting, project management, advanced features, etc.)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Confirmation & Onboarding**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- After submitting the form, they see a summary of their “estimated plan cost” or recommended tier."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- They can schedule an optional discovery call (if they need deeper scoping) or proceed to an immediate sign-up if they already know what they want."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Payment & Workspace Setup**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- For those ready to commit, you direct them to **Stripe** (or another billing platform) to initiate their subscription or retainer."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Once payment is confirmed, the client is **onboarded**: you set up Slack/Notion/Linear (whichever PM tool you use), share a welcome kit, and start the engagement."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Designing the Interactive Form / Rate Calculator**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Below is a sample question flow and the logic behind it. You can build this in tools like **Typeform**, **Tally**, **Jotform**, or even a **custom web form** on your site. For more advanced logic and design, consider **Bubble**, **Webflow** + **Memberstack**, or an integrated solution with **Notion** forms."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2.1. Core Sections**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Basic Info**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Contact Details**: Name, email, company name, etc."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Project Title** (optional): A short label so they can refer back to it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Service Requirements**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Check all that apply**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Branding / Visual Design"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- UI/UX"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Frontend Web Dev"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Backend / Database"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Mobile App Dev"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- DevOps / Maintenance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- AI / Automation / Integrations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- 3D / Animation / Physical Product Renders"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Consulting / Strategy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Logic**: Each selection adds weight to the final price or recommended tier."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Concurrency / Active Workstreams**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- “How many tasks or features do you anticipate needing *at the same time*?”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Options might be:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- 1 at a time (Basic)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- 2–3 at a time (Pro)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- 4+ at a time (Enterprise)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Logic**: More concurrency → higher monthly cost."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Project Complexity**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- “How complex are these tasks on average?”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Options could be:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Minor tasks/updates only"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Medium features (building new pages, moderate dev tasks)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Large-scale builds / multiple integrated systems"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Logic**: Large-scale builds significantly impact monthly cost or push them to a higher plan."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Preferred Turnaround**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- “Do you need tasks done within:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- 2–3 business days (fast)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- 1–2 weeks (moderate)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Flexible timelines (as needed)?”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Logic**: Tighter turnarounds might bump them into a higher tier or reflect a “rush” add-on."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. **Budget Range / Investment Level**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Ask if they have a monthly budget in mind (e.g., “Under $2k,” “$2k–$5k,” “$5k–$10k,” etc.)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Logic**: This can help you nudge them toward a plan that fits their price comfort."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "7. **Self-Managed vs. Fully Managed**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- “Do you plan to handle project management and prioritization yourself, or do you want us to handle that?”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If **self-managed**, they get a discounted rate (less overhead for you)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If **fully managed**, the calculator bumps up to reflect additional PM and strategy efforts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "8. **Optional Add-Ons**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- “Would you like additional consulting, workshops, advanced branding, or ongoing marketing support?”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Each add-on tacks an extra monthly fee or a one-time cost."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2.2. Scoring & Logic**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-68",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Assign Point Values**: For each question, you assign “weights.” E.g., if they pick “4+ concurrency,” add 20 points; if they want “complex backend,” add 15 points, etc."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-69",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Map Points to Plan**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- 0–20 points → Basic Tier"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- 21–40 points → Pro Tier"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- 41+ points → Enterprise"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-74",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Dynamic Price**: If you prefer direct pricing, each selection adds a cost increment. The form can sum these up and display a final “Estimated Monthly Rate.”"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Showing Results to the Client**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After they complete the form, display:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-79",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Recommended Tier**: e.g., “Based on your answers, we suggest the Pro Tier ($4,000/month).”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-80",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Breakdown**: “You chose [X concurrent tasks, advanced backend, 1–2 week turnaround], which adds up to [$Y].”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-81",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Call to Action**: “Click here to schedule a quick 15-minute discovery call” or “Click here to sign up now.”"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This final page is crucial—it provides immediate clarity and prompts the next step without friction."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Onboarding Steps**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Once the client either schedules a call or signs up:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-87",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Payment & Contract**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-88",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Direct them to **Stripe** subscriptions or a contract signing tool (HelloSign, DocuSign) if you use formal agreements."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-89",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Upon payment, you get a notification to kick off the next phase."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Welcome Email / Slack Invite**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Send a **welcome email** with a link to the Slack workspace or Slack Connect channel."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Include a short PDF or Notion page summarizing:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-93",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Their chosen plan and concurrency limit"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-94",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Basic guidelines on how to submit tasks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-95",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Estimated turnarounds or SLAs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-96",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Project Management Tool Setup**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-97",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If you’re using **Linear**, create a project or workspace for them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-98",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If you’re using **Notion**, create a dedicated space or board."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-99",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If they’re self-managed, share instructions on how to submit tasks, reorder priorities, etc."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-100",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If they’re fully managed, let them know your typical process and how you’ll handle scheduling."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-101",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Discovery Call (If Applicable)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-102",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Some clients might skip it, others might want it. Use this call to confirm scope, timeline, and answer any questions about the process."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-103",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If you have a “hands-off” or minimal approach, you can skip or shorten this significantly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-104",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5. Best Practices & Considerations**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-106",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Keep the Form Lean**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-107",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Too many questions can overwhelm prospects. Only ask for what genuinely helps you place them in the correct plan."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-108",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Clarify “Estimates”**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-109",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Make sure they know that **final pricing** or timelines may slightly adjust after deeper discussion, but the calculator gives a strong ballpark."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-110",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Use Automations**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-111",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- With **Zapier**, **Make (Integromat)**, or direct integrations, you can automatically add form submissions to your CRM, Slack channel, or PM tool. This reduces manual follow-up."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-112",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Communicate Boundaries**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-113",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If your model includes “unlimited requests” but limited concurrency, state that explicitly in the form’s explanation. Manage those expectations early."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-114",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **A/B Test**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-115",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Periodically test different question flows or visuals. See which approach yields more completions or better-aligned clients."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-116",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. **Offer an “I’m Not Sure Yet” Path**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-117",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- For clients who can’t answer certain questions, let them skip or pick a default. Then you can refine after a short call. This lowers form abandonment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-118",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-119",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Example of a Simple Question Flow**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-120",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Q1**: Which services do you need?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-122",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-121",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "(Check options) → Weighted pricing logic"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-123",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Q2**: How many concurrent tasks or “active requests” do you anticipate?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-127",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-124",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "1 → +X"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-125",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "2–3 → +Y"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-126",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "4+ → +Z"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-128",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Q3**: Complexity?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-130",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-129",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Minor / moderate / major → Different multipliers"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-131",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Q4**: Preferred turnaround speed?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-135",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-132",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Fast → +A"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-133",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Moderate → +B"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-134",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Flexible → +C"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-136",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Q5**: Self-Managed or Fully Managed?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-139",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-137",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Self → -10% discount from final cost"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-138",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Full → +10% or +20% to reflect PM overhead"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-140",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Q6**: Do you need any add-on services (consulting, 3D animations, advanced DevOps)?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-142",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-141",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Each selected item adds a certain cost."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-143",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Final**: Sum up → “We estimate your monthly subscription at $X.”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-144",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-145",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**6. Summary**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-149",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-146",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A **customer onboarding + interactive form + rate calculator** is an excellent way to pre-qualify leads, illustrate pricing tiers, and kick off projects with clarity."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-147",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Key elements**: Gather essential scope details, weigh them to generate a recommended plan, and confirm final steps in a frictionless manner."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-148",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "By combining **automation** and **clear next steps**, you reduce the manual back-and-forth while giving clients immediate confidence in your process."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-150",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ultimately, this approach ensures you and your client start on the **same page**—with transparent expectations about cost, timelines, and deliverables, all before any major work begins."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}